                    Treasury Department. No classification marking.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d266-f2" n="2" xml:id="d266-f2-content">
                <p>
                    Hodges’ December 2 letter to Dillon is ibid.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d266-f3" n="3" xml:id="d266-f3-content">
                <p>No other record of this November 23 meeting has been found.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
